- 编辑器根布局：[editor/index.vue](packages/visual-craft-core/src/views/editor/index.vue)
- Vite alias：[vite.config.ts](packages/web/vite.config.ts)
- TS paths：[tsconfig.json](packages/web/tsconfig.json)

